   "text": "SpacetimeDB module  (TypeScript, db \"accrual-docs\")\n\nPrivate tables + sender-checked views:\ndocuments, cases, facts, work_items, invoice_lines,\nledger_records, allocations, emails, attachments,\njobs, job_results, proposals, posting periods, settings\n\nReducers: finalize_import, start_review, claim / heartbeat /\ncomplete_job, build_proposal   |   lease sweep every 2s",
   "originalText": "SpacetimeDB module  (TypeScript, db \"accrual-docs\")\n\nPrivate tables + sender-checked views:\ndocuments, cases, facts, work_items, invoice_lines,\nledger_records, allocations, emails, attachments,\njobs, job_results, proposals, posting periods, settings\n\nReducers: finalize_import, start_review, claim / heartbeat /\ncomplete_job, build_proposal   |   lease sweep every 2s",
